    "author": "1367720667857223680",
    "displayName": "1367720667857223680",
    "text": "Did you know you can find startups hiring on X before they ever post on LinkedIn?\n\nOpen X.\n\nSearch:\n\n\"Looking for\" + (your skill)\n\n\"Need a\" + (your skill)\n\n\"We're hiring\" + (your skill)\n\n\"Just launched\"\n\n\"Introducing our MVP\"\n\n\"We're growing\"\n\n\"We just raised\"\n\n\u201cMVP is live\u201d\n\n\u201cBeta is live\u201d\n\n\"Looking for recommendations for\u201d (your skill)\n\n\"Need help with\" + (your skill)\n\n\"Hiring remotely\" + (your skill)\n\nFilter by Latest.\n\nResearch the business.\n\nSend a personalized cold pitch.\n\nYou'll find founders actively building businesses that often need help before they hire publicly.",
    "createdAt": "Thu Aug 06 10:45:31 +0000 2026",
    "url": "https://x.com/IkonoCatherine/status/2085316332862521681"
  },
